    "finalName": "",
    "description": "As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> you can use your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> to parry your opponents' attacks, gaining a +1 deflection bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> until the start of your next turn. You must have a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> drawn and ignited to use this Talent, and you don't gain the deflection bonus if you are <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flat-Footed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flat-Footed\">Flat-Footed</a> or otherwise unaware of the incoming attack.<br><br>You can take this Talent multiple times; each time you take this Talent, the deflection bonus increases by +1 (maximum +3).",
